  "recommendation": "HOLD",
  "claims": [
    {
      "claim_id": "C1",
      "text": "Revenue increased by 14.93% from $245,122 million in fiscal year 2024 to $281,724 million in fiscal year 2025.",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "EP_0002_E01"
      ],
      "check_spec": {
        "kind": "percentage_change",
        "from_fact_id": "EP_0002_F02",
        "to_fact_id": "EP_0002_F01",
        "metric": "revenue",
        "from_period": {
          "label": "FY2024",
          "start": "2023-07-01",
          "end": "2024-06-30"
        },
        "to_period": {
          "label": "FY2025",
          "start": "2024-07-01",
          "end": "2025-06-30"
        },
        "value": "14.93",
        "unit": "percent"
      }
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C2",
      "text": "Operating income increased by 17.45% from $109,433 million in fiscal year 2024 to $128,528 million in fiscal year 2025.",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "EP_0002_E01"
      ],
      "check_spec": {
        "kind": "percentage_change",
        "from_fact_id": "EP_0002_F06",
        "to_fact_id": "EP_0002_F05",
        "metric": "operating_income",
        "from_period": {
          "label": "FY2024",
          "start": "2023-07-01",
          "end": "2024-06-30"
        },
        "to_period": {
          "label": "FY2025",
          "start": "2024-07-01",
          "end": "2025-06-30"
        },
        "value": "17.45",
        "unit": "percent"
      }
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C3",
      "text": "Gross margin increased by 13.38% from $171,008 million in fiscal year 2024 to $193,893 million in fiscal year 2025.",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "EP_0002_E01"
      ],
      "check_spec": {
        "kind": "percentage_change",
        "from_fact_id": "EP_0002_F04",
        "to_fact_id": "EP_0002_F03",
        "metric": "gross_margin",
        "from_period": {
          "label": "FY2024",
          "start": "2023-07-01",
          "end": "2024-06-30"
        },
        "to_period": {
          "label": "FY2025",
          "start": "2024-07-01",
          "end": "2025-06-30"
        },
        "value": "13.38",
        "unit": "percent"
      }
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C4",
      "text": "Despite overall gross margin growth, the gross margin percentage for PRODUCT_10 decreased to 69% in fiscal year 2025 due to the impact of scaling AI infrastructure, partially offset by efficiency gains in PRODUCT_11 (Item 7, EP_0002_E02).",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "EP_0002_E02"
      ],
      "check_spec": {
        "kind": "numeric",
        "fact_id": "EP_0002_F07",
        "metric": "cloud_gross_margin_percentage",
        "period": {
          "label": "FY2025",
          "start": "2024-07-01",
          "end": "2025-06-30"
        },
        "value": "69",
        "unit": "percent"
      }
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C5",
      "text": "Operating expenses increased by $3.8 billion (the filing reports rounded growth of 6%) in fiscal year 2025, driven by investments in cloud and AI engineering and Gaming, including the impact of the ENTITY_01 acquisition (Item 7, EP_0002_E02). The company also faces intense competition across all markets, with low barriers to entry in many businesses and rapidly evolving technologies (Item 1A, EP_0002_E03).",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "EP_0002_E02",
        "EP_0002_E03"
      ],
      "check_spec": null
    }
  ],
  "rationale": "The company demonstrated strong top-line growth with revenue increasing by 14.93% and operating income by 17.45% in fiscal year 2025. Gross margin also increased by 13.38%. However, there are material counter-evidences that suggest a HOLD recommendation. The gross margin percentage for PRODUCT_10 decreased to 69% due to the scaling of AI infrastructure, indicating potential cost pressures in a key growth area. Furthermore, operating expenses increased by $3.8 billion (the filing reports rounded growth of 6%) due to investments in cloud and AI engineering and the ENTITY_01 acquisition. The company also acknowledges intense competition and low barriers to entry in many of its markets, posing ongoing risks to its financial performance. These factors, while not negating the overall growth, introduce uncertainties that warrant a cautious approach."
}

{
  "schema_version": "0.1",
  "report_id": "R_98049939f1e04251a14473a116e831d5",
  "recommendation": "HOLD",
  "claims": [
    {
      "claim_id": "C1",
      "text": "Total revenue increased by 114.20% from $60,922 million in the year ended January 28, 2024, to $130,497 million in the year ended January 26, 2025.",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "EP_0003_E01"
      ],
      "check_spec": {
        "kind": "percentage_change",
        "from_fact_id": "EP_0003_F02",
        "to_fact_id": "EP_0003_F01",
        "metric": "revenue",
        "from_period": {
          "label": "FY2024",
          "start": "2023-01-30",
          "end": "2024-01-28"
        },
        "to_period": {
          "label": "FY2025",
          "start": "2024-01-29",
          "end": "2025-01-26"
        },
        "value": "114.20",
        "unit": "percent"
      }
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C2",
      "text": "The SEGMENT_04 segment's revenue grew by 145.11% from $47,405 million in the year ended January 28, 2024, to $116,193 million in the year ended January 26, 2025, driven by strong demand for accelerated computing and AI solutions, specifically a 162% growth in Data Center computing revenue and a 51% growth in Data Center networking revenue.",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "EP_0003_E01",
        "EP_0003_E02"
      ],
      "check_spec": {
        "kind": "percentage_change",
        "from_fact_id": "EP_0003_F04",
        "to_fact_id": "EP_0003_F03",
        "metric": "compute_networking_revenue",
        "from_period": {
          "label": "FY2024",
          "start": "2023-01-30",
          "end": "2024-01-28"
        },
        "to_period": {
          "label": "FY2025",
          "start": "2024-01-29",
          "end": "2025-01-26"
        },
        "value": "145.11",
        "unit": "percent"
      }
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C3",
      "text": "The SEGMENT_05 segment's revenue increased by 5.82% from $13,517 million in the year ended January 28, 2024, to $14,304 million in the year ended January 26, 2025, primarily due to sales of PRODUCT_25 GPUs, but its operating income decreased due to a 44% increase in segment operating expenses.",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "EP_0003_E01",
        "EP_0003_E02"
      ],
      "check_spec": {
        "kind": "percentage_change",
        "from_fact_id": "EP_0003_F06",
        "to_fact_id": "EP_0003_F05",
        "metric": "graphics_revenue",
        "from_period": {
          "label": "FY2024",
          "start": "2023-01-30",
          "end": "2024-01-28"
        },
        "to_period": {
          "label": "FY2025",
          "start": "2024-01-29",
          "end": "2025-01-26"
        },
        "value": "5.82",
        "unit": "percent"
      }
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C4",
      "text": "The company faces risks from increasing economic sanctions and export controls, which could disrupt supply chains, negatively impact demand for products, and lead to excess inventory or supply charges, potentially benefiting competitors (Item 1A).",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "EP_0003_E03"
      ],
      "check_spec": null
    }
  ],
  "rationale": "The company demonstrated significant revenue growth, primarily driven by its SEGMENT_04 segment, which saw a 145.11% increase in revenue due to strong demand for AI and accelerated computing solutions. The overall revenue increased by 114.20% from fiscal year 2024 to fiscal year 2025. However, the SEGMENT_05 segment, while experiencing a 5.82% revenue increase, saw a decrease in operating income due to a 44% increase in operating expenses. Furthermore, the company faces material risks from export controls and economic sanctions, which could negatively impact demand, disrupt supply chains, and increase compliance burdens. Given the strong growth in one segment offset by challenges in another and significant external risks, a HOLD recommendation is appropriate."
}

